<title>PERU: Peru rebels say will kill foreign minister first.</title>
<headline>Peru rebels say will kill foreign minister first.</headline>
<dateline>LIMA 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Peruvian rebels holding 200 hostages in the Japanese ambassador's residence in Lima said at midday (1700 GMT) on Wednesday that they would kill Peruvian Foreign Minister Francisco Tudela within 20 minutes if their demands were not met.</p>
<p>&quot;The first victim will be Francisco Tudela,&quot; a guerrilla spokesman said in an interview with local television from inside the residence.</p>
